{
    "title": "ModeSens - Shopping Assistant",
    "description": "ModeSens is your free, digital shopping assistant \u2014 helping you shop from 12,000+ premium brands and 500+ store partners like Gucci, Fendi, Net-A-Porter, Farfetch, Nordstrom, Saks Fifth Avenue, Burberry, Louis Vuitton, Balenciaga, Dior, and many more.\r\n\r\nModeSens offers full designer collections for men, women, kids and home \u2014 with powerful filter capabilities, link search, barcode scanning, and informative product pages. Our smart shopping tools make it easy to compare price and availability, set sale alerts, curate collections and so much more. Real-time updates allow you to never miss an item in your size at the right price!\r\n\r\nJoin our community to share your favorite pieces and best looks, while also finding inspiration from style lovers like you.\r\n \r\nLuxury Fashion\r\nShop 12,000+ brands including Gucci, Balenciaga, Fendi, Versace & More.\r\n \r\nComparison Shopping\r\nCheck prices and availability across 500+ stores on every item for men, women, kids, and home.\r\n \r\nSearch Any Link\r\nCopy any link, open the app, and find it on ModeSens.\r\n \r\nBe The First to Know\r\nGet the inside scoop with alerts on sales, and keep up with what's new and back in stock\r\n \r\nShop New and Pre-Owned\r\nDiscover a collection of 5+ millions items worldwide in one place\r\n \r\nA Community for Shopping & Discovery\r\nShare your reviews and style, get inspired, and connect with others in the community\r\n \r\nCurated Shopping Experience\r\nBuild your own digital closet, create shopping lists, and collect what you like\r\n \r\nModeSens Rewards\r\nEarn points and enjoy our premium shopping assistant service and membership benefits\r\n \r\nShop With Confidence\r\nEnjoy authentic products and ModeSens Shopper Protection\r\n\r\nAccessibility\r\nText readers, which support people with visual impairments",
    "descriptionHTML": "ModeSens is your free, digital shopping assistant \u2014 helping you shop from 12,000+ premium brands and 500+ store partners like Gucci, Fendi, Net-A-Porter, Farfetch, Nordstrom, Saks Fifth Avenue, Burberry, Louis Vuitton, Balenciaga, Dior, and many more.<br><br>ModeSens offers full designer collections for men, women, kids and home \u2014 with powerful filter capabilities, link search, barcode scanning, and informative product pages. Our smart shopping tools make it easy to compare price and availability, set sale alerts, curate collections and so much more. Real-time updates allow you to never miss an item in your size at the right price!<br><br>Join our community to share your favorite pieces and best looks, while also finding inspiration from style lovers like you.<br> <br>Luxury Fashion<br>Shop 12,000+ brands including Gucci, Balenciaga, Fendi, Versace &amp; More.<br> <br>Comparison Shopping<br>Check prices and availability across 500+ stores on every item for men, women, kids, and home.<br> <br>Search Any Link<br>Copy any link, open the app, and find it on ModeSens.<br> <br>Be The First to Know<br>Get the inside scoop with alerts on sales, and keep up with what&#39;s new and back in stock<br> <br>Shop New and Pre-Owned<br>Discover a collection of 5+ millions items worldwide in one place<br> <br>A Community for Shopping &amp; Discovery<br>Share your reviews and style, get inspired, and connect with others in the community<br> <br>Curated Shopping Experience<br>Build your own digital closet, create shopping lists, and collect what you like<br> <br>ModeSens Rewards<br>Earn points and enjoy our premium shopping assistant service and membership benefits<br> <br>Shop With Confidence<br>Enjoy authentic products and ModeSens Shopper Protection<br><br>Accessibility<br>Text readers, which support people with visual impairments",
